*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"

*%============================================================
*% Brother QL-1100 - Native ARM64 CUPS Driver
*% Supports: 102mm die-cut and continuous DK labels
*%============================================================

*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion:   "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "QL1100.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*Product: "(Brother QL-1100)"
*ModelName: "QL-1100"
*ShortNickName: "Brother QL-1100"
*NickName: "Brother QL-1100 (ARM64)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90

*% CUPS-specific
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 rastertoql"
*cupsLanguages: "en"

*% ============================================================
*% Resolution
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 5 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ============================================================
*% Media Types  (maps to ql_media_info_t .ppd_name)
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *MediaType/Label Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: DK11241
*MediaType DK11241/DK-11241 (102mm x 152mm Die-Cut): ""
*MediaType DK11209/DK-11209 (62mm x 29mm Die-Cut): ""
*MediaType DK11202/DK-11202 (62mm x 100mm Die-Cut): ""
*MediaType DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): ""
*MediaType DK22246/DK-22246 (103mm Continuous): ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*% ============================================================
*% Auto Cut
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *AutoCut/Auto Cut: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *AutoCut
*DefaultAutoCut: True
*AutoCut True/Every Label and at End: ""
*AutoCut EndOnly/At End of Job Only: ""
*AutoCut False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *AutoCut

*% ============================================================
*% Horizontal Adjust — positive moves the print to the right
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *HorizontalAdjust/Horizontal Adjust: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 25 AnySetup *HorizontalAdjust
*DefaultHorizontalAdjust: None
*HorizontalAdjust Minus3/3mm Left: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Minus2/2mm Left: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Minus1/1mm Left: ""
*HorizontalAdjust None/None: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Plus1/1mm Right: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Plus2/2mm Right: ""
*HorizontalAdjust Plus3/3mm Right: ""
*CloseUI: *HorizontalAdjust

*% ============================================================
*% Label Scale — shrinks the whole label before trimming it to the
*% printable area (about 6mm top/bottom and 1.5mm sides on die-cut labels
*% cannot be printed).  Leave the app's own Scale at 100%.
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *LabelScale/Label Scale: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 26 AnySetup *LabelScale
*DefaultLabelScale: 98
*LabelScale 100/100%: ""
*LabelScale 98/98%: ""
*LabelScale 96/96%: ""
*LabelScale 95/95%: ""
*LabelScale 92/92%: ""
*LabelScale 90/90%: ""
*LabelScale Fit/Fit Printable Area: ""
*CloseUI: *LabelScale

*% ============================================================
*% Print Quality — sets the printer's "quality priority" flag
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *PrintQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 27 AnySetup *PrintQuality
*DefaultPrintQuality: Quality
*PrintQuality Quality/Best Quality (slower): ""
*PrintQuality Speed/Faster Printing: ""
*CloseUI: *PrintQuality

*% ============================================================
*% Halftone / Brightness / Contrast — the page arrives as 8-bit grey
*% and rastertoql converts it to black and white
*% ============================================================
*OpenUI *Halftone/Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 28 AnySetup *Halftone
*DefaultHalftone: ErrorDiffusion
*Halftone Binary/For Logos and Text: ""
*Halftone Dither/For Text and Graphics: ""
*Halftone ErrorDiffusion/For Labels Containing Images: ""
*CloseUI: *Halftone

*OpenUI *Brightness/Brightness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *Brightness
*DefaultBrightness: 0
*Brightness -20/-20: ""
*Brightness -15/-15: ""
*Brightness -10/-10: ""
*Brightness -5/-5: ""
*Brightness 0/0: ""
*Brightness 5/+5: ""
*Brightness 10/+10: ""
*Brightness 15/+15: ""
*Brightness 20/+20: ""
*CloseUI: *Brightness

*OpenUI *Contrast/Contrast: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 29 AnySetup *Contrast
*DefaultContrast: 0
*Contrast -20/-20: ""
*Contrast -15/-15: ""
*Contrast -10/-10: ""
*Contrast -5/-5: ""
*Contrast 0/0: ""
*Contrast 5/+5: ""
*Contrast 10/+10: ""
*Contrast 15/+15: ""
*Contrast 20/+20: ""
*CloseUI: *Contrast

*% ============================================================
*% Page sizes — one entry per label size
*% Die-cut labels: fixed dimensions
*% Continuous: we define a range using custom paper
*% ============================================================

*% --- Die-cut: DK-11241 102mm x 152mm ---
*% 102mm = 289pt, 152mm = 431pt  (1pt = 1/72 inch = 0.353mm)
*% 102mm / 0.353 = 288.9pt  152mm / 0.353 = 430.7pt
*DefaultPaperDimension: DK11241
*DefaultImageableArea: DK11241
*PaperDimension DK11241/DK-11241 (102x152mm): "288 432.96"
*ImageableArea  DK11241/DK-11241 (102x152mm): "0 0 288 432.96"

*% --- Die-cut: DK-11209 62mm x 29mm ---
*% 62mm = 175.6pt  29mm = 82.2pt
*PaperDimension DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "175.68 82.08"
*ImageableArea  DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "0 0 175.68 82.08"

*% --- Die-cut: DK-11202 62mm x 100mm ---
*% 62mm = 175.6pt  100mm = 283.5pt
*PaperDimension DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "175.68 283.44"
*ImageableArea  DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "0 0 175.68 283.44"

*% --- Continuous: DK-22205 62mm wide, variable length ---
*% We set a default length of 200mm (567pt); user can override with custom size
*PaperDimension DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "175.68 567"
*ImageableArea  DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "0 0 175.68 567"

*% --- Continuous: DK-22246 103mm wide, variable length ---
*% 103mm = 291.8pt
*PaperDimension DK22246/DK-22246 (103mm Continuous): "293.76 567"
*ImageableArea  DK22246/DK-22246 (103mm Continuous): "0 0 293.76 567"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: DK11241
*PageSize DK11241/DK-11241 (102x152mm): "<</PageSize[288 432.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 82.08]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 283.44]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DK22246/DK-22246 (103mm Continuous): "<</PageSize[293.76 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: DK11241
*PageRegion DK11241/DK-11241 (102x152mm): "<</PageSize[288 432.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK11209/DK-11209 (62x29mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 82.08]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK11202/DK-11202 (62x100mm): "<</PageSize[175.68 283.44]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK22205/DK-22205 (62mm Continuous): "<</PageSize[175.68 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DK22246/DK-22246 (103mm Continuous): "<</PageSize[293.76 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% ============================================================
*% CUPS Raster settings
*% ============================================================
*% 1-bit black/white, BlackIs1, 300dpi

*% ============================================================
*% Constraints — tie MediaType to PageSize
*% ============================================================
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11241 *PageSize DK11209
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11241 *PageSize DK11202
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11241 *PageSize DK22205
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11241 *PageSize DK22246
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11209 *PageSize DK11241
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11209 *PageSize DK11202
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11209 *PageSize DK22205
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11209 *PageSize DK22246
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11202 *PageSize DK11241
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11202 *PageSize DK11209
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11202 *PageSize DK22205
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK11202 *PageSize DK22246
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22205 *PageSize DK11241
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22205 *PageSize DK11209
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22205 *PageSize DK11202
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22205 *PageSize DK22246
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22246 *PageSize DK11241
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22246 *PageSize DK11209
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22246 *PageSize DK11202
*UIConstraints: *MediaType DK22246 *PageSize DK22205

*% ============================================================
*% End of PPD
*% ============================================================
